Set POSTMARK_SERVER_TOKEN (Postmark: Servers, your server, API Tokens) and MAIL_FROM (a sender on a verified domain or sender signature). In development without a token, emails still go to devtools.
Every app.mailer.send() now goes through Postmark. Extra message fields: cc, bcc, replyTo, headers, tag, metadata, attachments: [{ filename, content, contentType, cid }].
The Postmark tag defaults to meta.kind (password-reset, magic-link...). Options in calm.config.js: blocks: { 'mail-postmark': { messageStream, trackOpens, trackLinks } }
